{"seq":1,"slug":"cardiovascular-diseases","title":"大学临床医学 — 心血管疾病","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/internal-medicine/cardiovascular-diseases","wordCount":1636,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学临床医学-心血管疾病\">大学临床医学 — 心血管疾病</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>心血管疾病是全球第一大死因，涵盖冠心病、高血压、心律失常、心力衰竭和心脏瓣膜病等多个范畴。临床思维的起点是将患者的症状（胸痛、呼吸困难、心悸、晕厥）与血流动力学改变和心电活动异常联系起来。理解心脏的&quot;压力-容量-时间&quot;关系是把握所有心血管疾病共性规律的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"冠状动脉粥样硬化性心脏病-冠心病\">冠状动脉粥样硬化性心脏病（冠心病）</h3><p>冠心病（coronary heart disease, CHD）的核心病理是冠状动脉粥样硬化导致管腔狭窄或急性血栓闭塞。临床分型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>病理特征</th>\n<th>临床表现</th>\n<th>心肌标志物</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>稳定型心绞痛</td>\n<td>固定性狭窄 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>劳力后胸骨后压迫感，休息或含硝酸甘油 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> min 缓解</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不稳定型心绞痛</td>\n<td>斑块破裂+非闭塞性血栓</td>\n<td>静息痛或新发/恶化心绞痛</td>\n<td>正常或轻微升高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>急性ST段抬高型心肌梗死（STEMI）</td>\n<td>血栓完全闭塞冠脉</td>\n<td>剧烈持续胸痛 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> min，硝酸甘油无效</td>\n<td>cTnI/cTnT 显著升高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非ST段抬高型心肌梗死（NSTEMI）</td>\n<td>血栓不完全闭塞或微栓塞</td>\n<td>症状类似不稳定型心绞痛</td>\n<td>cTnI/cTnT 升高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>急性心肌梗死的处理原则是&quot;时间就是心肌&quot;——从症状发作到血管再通的时间直接决定心肌挽救量。PCI（经皮冠状动脉介入治疗）的目标是 <strong>Door-to-Balloon 时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span></span></span></span></span> min</strong>；溶栓治疗的窗口为发病 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> h 内，最佳效果在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> h 内。</p>\n<p>STEMI 的心电图演变规律：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[超急性期 0-2h] --&gt;|高尖T波| B[急性期 2-24h]&#10;    B --&gt;|ST段弓背向上抬高 + Q波出现| C[亚急性期 数天-数周]&#10;    C --&gt;|ST段回落 + T波倒置| D[陈旧期 &gt;数周]&#10;    D --&gt;|Q波持续存在 + T波可回正|E[瘢痕形成]\">graph LR\n    A[超急性期 0-2h] --&gt;|高尖T波| B[急性期 2-24h]\n    B --&gt;|ST段弓背向上抬高 + Q波出现| C[亚急性期 数天-数周]\n    C --&gt;|ST段回落 + T波倒置| D[陈旧期 &gt;数周]\n    D --&gt;|Q波持续存在 + T波可回正|E[瘢痕形成]</pre><h3 id=\"高血压\">高血压</h3><p>原发性高血压占高血压患者的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>90</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">90\\text{-}95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span>，病因涉及遗传、盐摄入、RAAS 激活、交感神经兴奋性增高等多因素。诊断标准（中国 2024）：诊室血压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>140</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>90</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mmHg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 140/90\\,\\text{mmHg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140/90</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>高血压的靶器官损害遵循&quot;压力-重构&quot;逻辑：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>心脏</strong>：左心室后负荷持续增加→向心性肥厚→舒张功能减退→最终收缩功能也下降→心力衰竭</li>\n<li><strong>脑</strong>：小动脉硬化→微动脉瘤→高血压脑出血（好发于基底节区豆纹动脉）</li>\n<li><strong>肾</strong>：入球小动脉玻璃样变→肾小球缺血萎缩→肾功能减退（高血压肾病）</li>\n<li><strong>视网膜</strong>：Keith-Wagener 分级 I-IV 级，从动脉变细到视乳头水肿</li>\n</ul>\n<p>降压药物按机制分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>代表药物</th>\n<th>主要机制</th>\n<th>适应证倾向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ACEI/ARB</td>\n<td>依那普利/缬沙坦</td>\n<td>阻断 RAAS</td>\n<td>糖尿病肾病、心衰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CCB</td>\n<td>氨氯地平</td>\n<td>阻断 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ca^{2+}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通道→血管扩张</td>\n<td>老年、单纯收缩期高血压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 受体阻滞剂</td>\n<td>美托洛尔</td>\n<td>降低心率和心输出量</td>\n<td>心率偏快、冠心病合并高血压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利尿剂</td>\n<td>氢氯噻嗪</td>\n<td>排钠利尿→降低血容量</td>\n<td>盐敏感型、老年</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"心力衰竭\">心力衰竭</h3><p>心力衰竭（heart failure, HF）是各种心脏病的终末状态。按射血分数（EF）分型：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>HFrEF</strong>（射血分数降低型）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF \\leq 40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>，以收缩功能障碍为主</li>\n<li><strong>HFmrEF</strong>（射血分数中间型）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>49</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF = 41\\text{-}49\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">41</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">49%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>HFpEF</strong>（射血分数保留型）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EF \\geq 50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>，以舒张功能障碍为主</li>\n</ul>\n<p>左心衰竭的核心症状是<strong>呼吸困难</strong>——从劳力性呼吸困难→端坐呼吸→夜间阵发性呼吸困难→急性肺水肿，反映肺静脉压力梯度的进行性升高。右心衰竭表现为体循环淤血：颈静脉怒张、肝大、下肢水肿、胸腹水。</p>\n<p>HFrEF 的&quot;金三角&quot;药物治疗方案——ACEI/ARB（或 ARNI）+ <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 受体阻滞剂 + 醛固酮受体拮抗剂（螺内酯）——已被大量随机对照试验证实可显著降低死亡率。近年来 SGLT2 抑制剂（达格列净、恩格列净）成为&quot;第四大支柱&quot;，即使在非糖尿病患者中也有明确心衰获益。</p>\n<h3 id=\"心律失常简介\">心律失常简介</h3><p>心律失常的分析从心电图出发。快速型心律失常按起源分为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>室上性</strong>：房颤（f 波取代 P 波，RR 间期绝对不等）、房扑、室上速</li>\n<li><strong>室性</strong>：室性早搏、室性心动过速（连续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 个宽 QRS 波）、室颤（致命性，需即刻电除颤）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>缓慢型心律失常包括窦性心动过缓（HR <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> bpm）和房室传导阻滞（I°、II° Mobitz I/II、III°）。III° 房室传导阻滞（完全性）表现为 P 波与 QRS 完全分离，心室率极慢（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\text{-}40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> bpm），可能需要起搏器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位 55 岁男性突发剧烈胸骨后压榨性疼痛 2 小时，心电图示 V1-V4 导联 ST 段弓背向上抬高。判断最可能的诊断、梗死部位和罪犯血管，并列出急诊处理的优先步骤。</li>\n<li>对比 HFrEF 与 HFpEF 在病理生理机制、超声心动图表现和药物治疗策略上的差异。</li>\n<li>一位高血压患者合并 2 型糖尿病和蛋白尿，请从指南角度选择最合适的降压药物组合，并解释选择依据。</li>\n<li>心电图上看到&quot;P 波与 QRS 波群完全无关&quot;，心室率约 35 bpm。请判断心律失常类型，并说明为什么该患者面临阿-斯综合征（晕厥甚至猝死）的风险。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Harrison&#39;s Principles of Internal Medicine</strong>（心血管病章节）：权威内科学参考，冠心病和心衰部分尤为详尽。</li>\n<li><strong>Braunwald&#39;s Heart Disease</strong>：心血管病学的&quot;圣经&quot;级专著。</li>\n<li><strong>ESC/AHA 指南</strong>：关注最新版 STEMI 管理指南、心力衰竭指南和高血压指南，各有在线免费全文。</li>\n<li><strong>ECG 学习资源</strong>：Life in the Fast Lane (LITFL) 网站提供大量真实心电图案例和逐步分析。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>心血管疾病的临床逻辑围绕&quot;供需平衡&quot;展开：冠心病是心肌氧供不足，高血压是后负荷过高导致心脏重构，心力衰竭是泵功能失代偿的终末表现，心律失常是电活动紊乱影响机械功能。从冠脉狭窄到心肌梗死再到心室重构和心衰，这一病理生理链条将多个看似独立的疾病串联为连续的疾病谱——&quot;心血管事件链&quot;。早期干预（控制危险因素）和精准用药（基于循证的&quot;金三角&quot;方案）是改善预后的核心策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学临床医学 — 心血管疾病","id":"大学临床医学-心血管疾病"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"冠状动脉粥样硬化性心脏病（冠心病）","id":"冠状动脉粥样硬化性心脏病-冠心病"},{"level":3,"text":"高血压","id":"高血压"},{"level":3,"text":"心力衰竭","id":"心力衰竭"},{"level":3,"text":"心律失常简介","id":"心律失常简介"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 病理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/basic-medicine/pathology"},"next":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 呼吸系统疾病","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/internal-medicine/respiratory-diseases"}}